    "body": ">> For other repositories, I guess it's unclear whether Bikeshed counts as HTML. Or for that matter whether source does.\r\n\r\n> It seems better to pretend it's HTML than shell script.\r\n\r\nAh I see now I misunderstood the first comment\r\n\r\nAnyway having GitHub label those “HTML” seems the closest approximation, unless for Bikeshed at least we try getting it into https://github.com/github/linguist/blob/master/lib/linguist/languages.yml.\r\n\r\nFor `source` though I wouldn’t even know what to call it if we were to get it added. “Wattsi input”?…",
